# Docker build context excludes. The build context is the repo ROOT (both
# docker/ui.Dockerfile and docker/engine.Dockerfile build from here).
#
# CRITICAL: dependencies are installed FRESH inside each image (pnpm install in
# the deps stage). The host's node_modules are pnpm symlink farms pointing at the
# ROOT node_modules/.pnpm store, which is NOT copied into the image — so if a host
# node_modules rode along via `COPY packages/<x>/`, its symlinks would DANGLE and
# clobber the image's clean install (tsc "Cannot find module ..."). Never ship
# host node_modules into a multi-stage node image.
node_modules
**/node_modules

# Build output — every package is rebuilt inside the image, in dependency order.
**/dist
**/dist-ssr

# Generated plugin-runtime bits: the vendor ESM bundle + import-map are produced
# by `build:vendor` INSIDE the image. The FREE staged plugin tree
# (packages/ui/public/plugins/) is deliberately NOT ignored — the prestaged
# docker path needs it in the context (see ui.Dockerfile).
packages/ui/public/vendor
packages/ui/public/import-map.json

# Premium plugin bytes never belong in the ui image (they are engine-mounted).
staged-premium

# VCS, tooling, test and editor artifacts (context bloat / irrelevant to a build).
.git
.gitignore
**/.vite
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
.vscode
.idea
